        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a role-playing tower defense (RP TD) game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is similar to defense-style maps from <i>Warcraft III</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 36 waves of enemies, drawing inspiration from the gameplay of the popular <i>Zhu Xian</i>defense map and the story setting of the <i>Zhu Xian</i>novel.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 7 unique heroes at the start: Yun Tian, Qing Xuan, Xiao Fan, Shi Tou, Lu Xueqi, Jing Yu, and Fa Xiang, each with their own distinctive skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from multiple difficulty levels: Easy, Medium, Hard, and Extreme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Newbie Quest system helps players get started by providing initial equipment and experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 15 distinct Secret Realms (dungeons), such as Flame Dragon Valley, Ten-Millennium Spider Cave, and Illusory Moon Cave, each offering specific equipment rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase weapons, armor, and accessories from various in-game shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the Bagua Stone upgrade system, craft Immortal Artifacts from fragments, and assign stat points freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Immortal Artifacts include items like the Wuwei Stone, Four Symbols Ring, Zhanhao Divine Wings, Illusory Feather Wings, and Sky Jade Mirror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary equipment, such as the Kirin Gauntlets, Demon-Subduing Sword, and Divine Moon Chord, can be enhanced through combat (attacking/being attacked) or by using Refinement Stones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Bloodforge system to fuse a +5 enhanced Legendary item with an Immortal Artifact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters can undergo Rebirth to retain their stats and can join the Bloodforge Hall for advanced equipment refinement.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a role-playing tower defense (RP TD) game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is similar to defense-style maps from <i>Warcraft III</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 36 waves of enemies, drawing inspiration from the gameplay of the popular <i>Zhu Xian</i>defense map and the story setting of the <i>Zhu Xian</i>novel.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 7 unique heroes at the start: Yun Tian, Qing Xuan, Xiao Fan, Shi Tou, Lu Xueqi, Jing Yu, and Fa Xiang, each with their own distinctive skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from multiple difficulty levels: Easy, Medium, Hard, and Extreme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Newbie Quest system helps players get started by providing initial equipment and experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 15 distinct Secret Realms (dungeons), such as Flame Dragon Valley, Ten-Millennium Spider Cave, and Illusory Moon Cave, each offering specific equipment rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase weapons, armor, and accessories from various in-game shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the Bagua Stone upgrade system, craft Immortal Artifacts from fragments, and assign stat points freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Immortal Artifacts include items like the Wuwei Stone, Four Symbols Ring, Zhanhao Divine Wings, Illusory Feather Wings, and Sky Jade Mirror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary equipment, such as the Kirin Gauntlets, Demon-Subduing Sword, and Divine Moon Chord, can be enhanced through combat (attacking/being attacked) or by using Refinement Stones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Bloodforge system to fuse a +5 enhanced Legendary item with an Immortal Artifact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters can undergo Rebirth to retain their stats and can join the Bloodforge Hall for advanced equipment refinement.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Defense map, fantasy setting, item synthesis/crafting, enhancement/upgrade, multiple selectable heroes, gameplay similar to Warcraft III-style defense maps.",
